## Visual reference
- Shopper screens: `docs/ui-reference/` screenshots **and** live shop.app. Match shop.app look with Persian RTL and `VitranTheme`.
- Admin screens: `docs/ui-reference/admin/` only (Shopify Admin cards / store-plan purple brand). Persian RTL still applies.
- Do **not** use Material3 `NavigationBar` / `NavigationRail` for app chrome.

## When to use
- Always, for any screen/section UI work in this repo.

## When to update
- Active screen changes (e.g. leave Product detail for Deals).
- Product detail or Categories section order changes.
- Shared section-gap token or page rhythm changes.
- Package paths for components/screens settle or move.
